<title>GERMANY: Henkel 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Henkel 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   515     vs 488</p>
<p>    Group sales				  16,301  vs 14,198</p>
<p>NOTE - German chemicals group Henkel said its revenues this year would be significantly increased by the acquisitions of Loctite and Novamax. Henkel also forecast growth of its existing business.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
